16	\N	\N	2025-12-01 22:09:59.080753	1		{"en_US": ""}	analytic	Odoo S.A.	/base/static/description/icon.png	installed	19.0.1.2	{"en_US": "Analytic Accounting", "es_ES": "Contabilidad analítica"}	2	{"en_US": "\\nModule for defining analytic accounting object.\\n===============================================\\n\\nIn Odoo, analytic accounts are linked to general accounts but are treated\\ntotally independently. So, you can enter various different analytic operations\\nthat have no counterpart in the general financial accounts.\\n", "es_ES": "\\nMódulo para definir el objeto de contabilidad analítica\\n===============================================\\n\\nEn Odoo, las cuentas analíticas están vinculadas a las cuentas generales, pero se tratan de\\nforma totalmente independiente. Por tanto, se pueden introducir varias operaciones\\nanalíticas diferentes que no tengan contrapartida en la contabilidad financiera general.\\n"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N			* INHERIT account.analytic.account.list.select (list)\naccount.analytic.account.kanban (kanban)\naccount.analytic.account.list (list)\naccount.analytic.account.search (search)\naccount.analytic.distribution.model.form (form)\naccount.analytic.distribution.model.list (list)\naccount.analytic.line.form (form)\naccount.analytic.line.graph (graph)\naccount.analytic.line.kanban (kanban)\naccount.analytic.line.list (list)\naccount.analytic.line.pivot (pivot)\naccount.analytic.line.select (search)\naccount.analytic.plan.form (form)\naccount.analytic.plan.list (list)\nanalytic.analytic.account.form (form)	official	\N
421	\N	\N	2025-11-28 09:05:14.534767	1		{"en_US": ""}	product	Odoo S.A.	/product/static/description/icon.png	installed	19.0.1.2	{"en_US": "Products & Pricelists", "es_ES": "Productos y listas de precios"}	11	{"en_US": "\\nThis is the base module for managing products and pricelists in Odoo.\\n========================================================================\\n\\nProducts support variants, different pricing methods, vendors information,\\nmake to stock/order, different units of measure, packaging and properties.\\n\\nPricelists support:\\n-------------------\\n    * Multiple-level of discount (by product, category, quantities)\\n    * Compute price based on different criteria:\\n        * Other pricelist\\n        * Cost price\\n        * List price\\n        * Vendor price\\n\\nPricelists preferences by product and/or partners.\\n\\nPrint product labels with barcode.\\n", "es_ES": "\\nEste es el módulo base para gestionar productos y listas de precios en Odoo.\\n========================================================================\\n\\nLos productos son compatibles con variantes, varios métodos de fijación de precios, información del proveedor, información de almacenaje, distintas unidades de medida, embalajes y propiedades.\\n\\nLas listas de precios son compatibles con:\\n-------------------------------\\n    * Varios niveles de descuento (por producto, categoría, cantidades)\\n    * Calcular precio según distintos criterios:\\n        * Otra lista de precios\\n        * Precio de coste\\n        * Precio de venta\\n        * Precio de proveedor\\n\\nLas preferencias de la lista de precios se establecen por producto o contacto.\\n\\nImprima etiquetas de producto con código de barras.\\n"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	100	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N		Packaging Barcodes (PDF)\nPricelist\nProduct Label (PDF)\nProduct Label 2x7 (PDF)\nProduct Label 4x12 (PDF)\nProduct Label 4x12 No Price (PDF)\nProduct Label 4x7 (PDF)	* INHERIT product.pricelist.item.product.product.form.inherit (form)