109	\N	\N	2025-12-01 22:09:59.080753	1		{"en_US": "Web Routing", "es_ES": "Enrutamiento web"}	http_routing	Odoo S.A.	/base/static/description/icon.png	installed	19.0.1.0	{"en_US": "Web Routing", "es_ES": "Enrutamiento web"}	4	{"en_US": "\\nProposes advanced routing options not available in web or base to keep\\nbase modules simple.\\n", "es_ES": "\\nPropone opciones de enrutamiento avanzadas que no están disponibles en la web o en los módulos base\\npara mantener simples los módulos base.\\n"}	f	f	f	LGPL-3	9100	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N			* INHERIT res.lang.form.http_routing.inherit (form)\n* INHERIT res.lang.list.model.inherit (list)\n400 (qweb)\n403 (qweb)\n415 (qweb)\n422 (qweb)\n4xx (qweb)\n500 (qweb)\nHTTP Error (qweb)\nPage Not Found (qweb)\nerror_message (qweb)\nhttp_error_debug (qweb)	official	\N
